---@field ifGenerationMatch? string Makes the operation conditional on whether the destination object's current generation matches the given value. Setting to 0 makes the operation succeed only if there are no live versions of the object. `ifGenerationMatch` and `ifGenerationNotMatch` conditions are mutually exclusive: it's an error for both of them to be set in the request.
