---@field sourceObject string Name of the source object. For information about how to URL encode object names to be path safe, see [Encoding URI Path Parts](https://cloud.google.com/storage/docs/request-endpoints#encoding).
---@field userProject? string The project to be billed for this request. Required for Requester Pays buckets.

